Description: Stained Glass OS session glue
 Brings up a Stained Glass desktop session: a compositor hosting Wine's
 explorer as the shell, running against a system-wide Wine prefix rather than
 a per-user one.
 .
 This package supplies the session entry point, the prefix initializer, the
 Windows-style login and lock screens (a Wine greeter, its bridge to greetd,
 and the sg-lockd lock service), and the scripted gates the image boot test
 consumes. The compositor is sg-compositor, or cage as a fallback.
